  "title": "nmea0183: Add DPT sentence dissector",
  "description": "Add sentence dissector for DPT messages.\n\n* The fields are named and display their contents\n* Fields display the unit of the value\n* Report an expected but missing field\n\n### Tested\n\nThis pcap contains various messages, including DPT sentences: [nmea-simulator.pcapng](/wireshark/wireshark/uploads/548270d368a136cead8df2d76f29c9e1/nmea-simulator.pcapng)\n\nThis pcap contains invalid variants of DPT sentence: [nmea-test-messages.pcapng](/uploads/a5620571ce85cab33b4429ec4d2c3ce6/nmea-test-messages.pcapng)\n\nI have run 500 iterations of `fuzz-test.sh` with these captures.",
